{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはよう(´˘`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はクリスマスでしたね!🎅🎄\nメリークリスマス!プレゼントもらいましたか?\n私はまだです😭お菓子ほしいな〜\nぺーちゃんと過ごしました。\nいえーい。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJTT0FV3VY7HQ4VJG1YVAG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJTTZ3T97VP5JEG6MTPBXB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺーと久しぶりに遊べて嬉しいな〜\nぺーといると気を使わないので、時間が沢山あっても暇になりません⏰\nぺーは、癒し🍀*゜\n美味しいものをたくさん食べて、たくさん遊んで話して、いい日になりました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肉とパン、アイス、ジェラート、、、幸せでした!\n何を食べるか決める時に、ぺーは美味しいものをたくさん知っているので助かりました☺️\nまた、いこーね〜( ∩¨∩ )💕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼女とデートなう。 で使っていいよ(流行りに乗ってみる)\nうきわ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJTVYWAY3QPQ32DM4T0GQJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うま"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJTWYCGXNQC4WKMBC4MFA8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJTXXRZ90VWJY85106M66E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスっぽい飾り🎄"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJTYYCP2ZZJGTF8JAR2M9V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あともう少しで年末!\n一週間、楽しんでいきましょー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}